{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2022-05-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA ANNOUNCES 2023 FINANCIAL REPORTING DATES', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , MAY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BANK OF AMERICA TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FOLLOWING REPORTING DATES FOR QUARTERLY FINANCIAL RESULTS: FOURTH QUARTER 2022 – FRIDAY, JANUARY 13, 2023 FIRST QUARTER 2023 – TUESDAY, APRIL 18, 2023 SECOND QUARTER 2023 – TUESDAY, JULY 18, 2023 THIRD QUARTER 2023 – TUESDAY, OCTOBER 17, 2023 THE RESULTS WILL BE RELEASED AT APPROXIMATELY 6:45 A.M.'}